# USMALLINT EXCEPT (SMALLINT EXCEPT DECIMAL(9,2)): the parenthesized EXCEPT folds first, DECIMAL(9,2).
query D rowsort
SELECT u16 FROM edge EXCEPT (SELECT i16 FROM edge EXCEPT SELECT d9_2 FROM decimals)
----
DECIMAL(9,2)
